      "content": "thanks! that's a pretty good start and it doesn't sound too crazy. \n\nbut i just checked my practice dashboard and with that version i only got a 4/20 on the impact score. the trainer said the \"impact engine\" is super sensitive to those specific power words. i need to get a much higher score to actually pass this module.\n\ncan you try another version? try to boost the impact score as much as possible by using more of those strong terms like 'revolutionary', 'unparalleled', 'seamless', 'groundbreaking', 'robust', etc. just... please don't make it look like you're just throwing words at a wall. i need it to still pass the \"readability\" check so it doesn't look like a bot wrote it.",
